OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,CSunday:FOn the whole Sunday promises   
OL,6,Fto be a brighter day than Saturday,    
OL,7,Falthough a scattering of showers are   
OL,8,Flikely to feed across the country in   
OL,9,Fthe southwesterly breeze.              
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,12,Fand Tuesday look mild, cloudy and      
OL,13,Fwindy with outbreaks of rain, which    
OL,14,Fcould turn heavy. The rain should      
OL,15,Fclear to leave a sunnier day on        
OL,16,FWednesday, with scattered showers.     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
